<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's Mitac 1996 net down 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's Mitac 1996 net down 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-December 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			     12,497 vs 12,362</p>
<p>    Net profit				135 vs    154</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitac International Corp is one of Taiwan's leading computer makers.</p>
<p>Its board meeting has proposed to issue a stock dividend, or bonus issue of T$1.2 per share for 1996, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>The proposal needs shareholders' approval at a meeting slated for May 20, it said. -- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
